<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MARCH 26.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MARCH 26.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Latvian state radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Foreign Ministry State secretary visit to Belarus, planned for today, has been cancelled.</p>
<p>- West European Union (WEU) secretary general arrived in Riga for a two-day visit.</p>
<p>- President Guntis Ulmanis plans to visit Helsinki on March 27 and discuss both the results of Russian-U.S. summit and bilateral relations.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
